# Modular Real-Time Chat Server in C#

Below is a comprehensive implementation of a modular real-time chat server in C# with the three requested components. This design follows SOLID principles and uses dependency injection for loose coupling.

## 1. Core Architecture

```csharp
// IChatServer.cs - Main interface defining the server contract
public interface IChatServer
{
    Task StartAsync(CancellationToken stoppingToken);
    Task StopAsync(CancellationToken stoppingToken);
    void RegisterClient(IClientConnection client);
    void UnregisterClient(Guid clientId);
    Task JoinRoomAsync(Guid clientId, string roomId);
    Task LeaveRoomAsync(Guid clientId, string roomId);
    Task SendMessageAsync(Guid clientId, string roomId, string message);
